// No declaration, so these do not load Experiments/JsonIntentRecoveryLab/M0/corpus/example_07_tagged.json:
//   $.operations (line 2, column 17): a tagged array: "type" says which members an object has (credit, debit, transfer), and Json reads no enum that carries a payload
//
// Choices:
//   $: record
//     record: 3.00 = keys read as field names 2.00 x 1.00 + few members 1.00 x 1.00
//     keyed table: 0.50 = values share a type 0.50 x 1.00
//   $.operations: tagged array
//     table: 1.52 = members every object has 2.00 x 0.43 + objects differ only by members left out 2.00 x 0.33
//     tagged array: 2.58 = objects have members the others lack 2.00 x 0.67 + a member named like a tag 1.00 x 1.00 + the tag decides the members 0.50 x 0.50
